PASS   signer A         GA2X2B4HKQVFI2TKAY5DCAIGI3GYJQGTPL4QO6KORW5VA4U5SHYCQAYR
PASS   signer B         GCJOFGD2OQXRJNAVFEUDEK44XVW5URWEARYEJAHOCKNZDQ2EIDGZTYXT
PASS   smart account    CBCBMDLNLVEDVZZY6AFWGU2TQWJ4UVHPCRL6NELZQO3B5577RXBXN6HP
PASS   account funded   14000000 stroops
PASS   rule 1 installed: interpreter only, signers A + B
PASS   rule 2 installed: interpreter + simple_threshold(2), signers A + B
PASS   CONTROL: signer A ALONE permitted through rule 1 - this is the any-of-N inversion
PASS   SUBJECT: signer A alone DENIED #3202 (SimpleThresholdError::NotAllowed)
PASS   SUBJECT: signers A + B TOGETHER permitted through rule 2
RESULT BOUND: 2-of-2 holds - one signer denied #3202, two permitted.
RESULT The control permitted that same lone signer, so the threshold is what refused.

